@LinkdUnified_HostAddress = http://localhost:5044

### 1. Connect LinkedIn Account (Using Session Cookie li_at)
POST {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/accounts/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionCookie": "AQEDAThYEe0Ez5taAAABoHGPhPIAAAGglZwI8lYAHVcbD6cmBYkVb8XCtyiJY7gPIIXib5LiDIEQBECPn-cxiYFcgDwic4sXxpALYvw9VsAu-OC5h3e17NGR3XyAUoZJKlxj96i7qPmaGYIX8miPmE7K"
}

### 2. Register a Webhook to Receive Real-Time New Message Events
POST {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/webhooks/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUrl": "https://webhook.site/your-unique-url",
  "secret": "my-secure-secret-key"
}

### 3. List Registered Webhooks
GET {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/webhooks
Accept: application/json

### 4. Instant Live View: Recent Incoming Messages from Database (Real-Time)
GET {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/db/messages/recent?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Synced Conversations from SQL Server Database
GET {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/db/conversations
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Messages for a Conversation from SQL Server Database
GET {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/db/conversations/2-MzM1OWE2NmIt.../messages
Accept: application/json

### 7. Trigger Manual Immediate Sync (Fetches live messages and pushes Webhook)
POST {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/sync
Accept: application/json

### 8. View Webhook Delivery Logs
GET {{LinkdUnified_HostAddress}}/api/linkedin/webhooks/logs
Accept: application/json
